# ICH (CSI @) inserts blanks and shifts the rest of the line right. The
# character under the cursor must move, not be overwritten -- shells use ICH for
# mid-line insertion on every keystroke.
size: 10x2
description: insert-character shifts the cursor cell rightwards

--- input
abcd\e[1;3H\e[1@

--- expect-grid
|ab cd|
||
